internal/s2ops contains code ported from the S2 Geometry Library
(https://github.com/google/s2geometry, commit
677c8cebcff11ba11accc0b02005bc214e06e9fd), Copyright Google Inc., under the
Apache License, Version 2.0: S2BooleanOperation (src/s2/s2boolean_operation.cc),
S2Builder and its snapping and edge-chain simplification
(src/s2/s2builder.cc), S2Builder::Graph (src/s2/s2builder_graph.cc), the
S2Builder layers S2PolygonLayer, S2PolylineVectorLayer and S2PointVectorLayer
and the ClosedSetNormalizer (src/s2/s2builderutil_*.cc), S2WindingOperation
(src/s2/s2winding_operation.cc, src/s2/s2builderutil_get_snapped_winding_delta.cc),
S2BufferOperation's offset curves (src/s2/s2buffer_operation.cc), and
predicates and edge-crossing helpers golang/geo lacks (src/s2/s2predicates.cc,
src/s2/s2edge_crossings.cc, src/s2/s2edge_crosser.h). Each ported file keeps
Google's copyright line; internal/s2ops/PROVENANCE.md records every file, its
upstream path, and what was taken and what was changed.
